differential calculus.

00:40:00.210 --> 00:40:03.990
And this was made by Leibniz and Newton.

00:40:03.990 --> 00:40:08.600
So this was the fluid of
abduction in mathematics.

00:40:08.600 --> 00:40:11.617
There is a famous book by Lakatos,

00:40:11.617 --> 00:40:15.330
"Proof: Demonstration and Refutation,"

00:40:15.330 --> 00:40:17.910
that is about this constructure.

00:40:17.910 --> 00:40:22.770
And so of course you can take
advantage to make abduction,

00:40:22.770 --> 00:40:27.060
for instance, in medical
reasoning of external tool,

00:40:27.060 --> 00:40:29.940
computational tools and so on.

00:40:29.940 --> 00:40:34.290
There are many books already
written about the role

00:40:34.290 --> 00:40:39.150
of artificial intelligence
in scientific discovery

00:40:39.150 --> 00:40:43.813
as a kind of help of
tool of an external aid

00:40:50.205 --> 00:40:52.280
to your heuristics.

00:40:54.600 --> 00:40:56.880
- [Priya] Next question.

00:40:56.880 --> 00:40:58.920
- [Audience Member] Thanks.

00:40:58.920 --> 00:41:00.603
I really enjoyed your talk.

00:41:01.830 --> 00:41:03.510
I couldn't help but notice

00:41:03.510 --> 00:41:07.585
that you avoided the words,
inspiration and intuition.

00:41:07.585 --> 00:41:08.418
- The word?

00:41:08.418 --> 00:41:10.020
- [Audience Member] You avoided the words,

00:41:10.020 --> 00:41:13.293
inspiration and intuition,

00:41:14.340 --> 00:41:18.003
and I was wondering why you did not.

00:41:20.717 --> 00:41:22.440
- It is good question.

00:41:22.440 --> 00:41:25.130
But I solved this question

00:41:25.130 --> 00:41:28.203
using Charles Sanders Peirce, okay?

00:41:30.330 --> 00:41:35.330
Charles Sanders Peirce, me
too, say in human beings

00:41:35.519 --> 00:41:38.850
there is the possibility of the

00:41:38.850 --> 00:41:42.180
so-called instinctual abduction.

00:41:42.180 --> 00:41:45.904
That is when you produce instantly

00:41:45.904 --> 00:41:50.250
and suddenly an hypothetical result.

00:41:50.250 --> 00:41:53.310
And it is true, it is good, okay?

00:41:53.310 --> 00:41:56.730
There is, in this case,
it is difficult to analyze

00:41:56.730 --> 00:41:59.470
because you do not have any awareness

00:42:00.457 --> 00:42:03.840
of the mechanism until now.

00:42:03.840 --> 00:42:07.350
Maybe in the future there will
be some neurological research

00:42:07.350 --> 00:42:08.910
that will be able to explain.

00:42:08.910 --> 00:42:12.534
- [Priya] On the mouse brain
and the mouse retina, right?

00:42:12.534 --> 00:42:15.180
- Like they figure out the
mouse brain for instance.

00:42:15.180 --> 00:42:20.180
But it is typical of human
beings to use instinct.

00:42:20.812 --> 00:42:25.812
So for instance, some physicians
are particularly endowed

00:42:26.370 --> 00:42:31.370
with this capacity to make
instantly a diagnostic.

00:42:32.550 --> 00:42:34.530
This is typical of human being.

00:42:34.530 --> 00:42:37.020
You cannot implement in a,

00:42:37.020 --> 00:42:40.015
I collaborated with the
computational scientist

00:42:40.015 --> 00:42:45.015
to programs at the first decade
of artificial intelligence

00:42:46.153 --> 00:42:49.380
on diagnostic medical reasoning.

00:42:49.380 --> 00:42:52.068
And in that case you
have to write a program,

00:42:52.068 --> 00:42:55.620
and so then you can say the result

00:42:55.620 --> 00:42:57.820
of the machine is instinctual

00:42:59.656 --> 00:43:04.050
but it is fake because in
reality you know which program

00:43:04.050 --> 00:43:06.840
was able to arrive to the result.

00:43:06.840 --> 00:43:07.680
This is typical.

00:43:07.680 --> 00:43:12.092
It is a kind of philosophical
and psychological term,

00:43:12.092 --> 00:43:16.050
and so I avoid the data just because

00:43:16.050 --> 00:43:19.650
there was not opportunity
to quote extinct abduction.

00:43:19.650 --> 00:43:22.848
Also in animals, in animal cognition,

00:43:22.848 --> 00:43:26.880
there is this capacity
of making abduction,

00:43:26.880 --> 00:43:31.880
for instance in superior
mammals and cats and so on.

00:43:32.370 --> 00:43:37.290
And of course they are not
using our syntactical language,

00:43:37.290 --> 00:43:41.643
but they are capable to arrive to result.

00:43:43.050 --> 00:43:44.130
